  --smart-section-tabs: list # A list of [Smart Section](https://www.docusign.com/blog/dsdev-deep-dive-responsive-smart-sections) tabs. Smart Section tabs enhance responsive signing on mobile devices by enabling collapsible sections, page breaks, custom formatting options, and other advanced functionality. **Note:** Smart Sections are a premium feature. Responsive signing must also be enabled for your account. — item shape: {anchorAllowWhiteSpaceInCharacters?: string, anchorAllowWhiteSpaceInCharactersMetadata?: record, anchorCaseSensitive?: string, anchorCaseSensitiveMetadata?: record, anchorHorizontalAlignment?: string, anchorHorizontalAlignmentMetadata?: record, anchorIgnoreIfNotPresent?: string, anchorIgnoreIfNotPresentMetadata?: record, anchorMatchWholeWord?: string, anchorMatchWholeWordMetadata?: record, anchorString?: string, anchorStringMetadata?: record, anchorTabProcessorVersion?: string, ... (73 more fields)}
