  --require-signer-certificate-type: string # Sets the Digital Signature certificate requirements for sending envelopes. Valid values are: - `none`: A Digital Signature certificate is not required. - `docusign_express`: Signers must use a DocuSign Express certificate. - `docusign_personal`: Signers must use a DocuSign personal certificate. - `safe` - `open_trust`: Signers must use an OpenTrust certificate.
