  --self-signed-recipient-email-document: string # Sets how self-signed documents are presented to the email recipients. Valid values are: - `include_pdf`: A PDF of the completed document is attached to the email. - `include_link`: A secure link to the self-signed documents is included in the email. **Note:** Only Admin users can change this setting.
