  --date-tabs: list # A list of [Date tabs][date]. A Date tab enables the recipient to enter a date. This value can't be set. The tooltip for this tab recommends the date format MM/DD/YYYY, but several other date formats are also accepted. The system retains the format that the recipient enters. **Note:** If you need to enforce a specific date format, DocuSign recommends that you use a Text tab with a validation pattern and validation message. [date]: /docs/esign-rest-api/reference/envelopes/enveloperecipienttabs/ — item shape: {anchorAllowWhiteSpaceInCharacters?: string, anchorAllowWhiteSpaceInCharactersMetadata?: record, anchorCaseSensitive?: string, anchorCaseSensitiveMetadata?: record, anchorHorizontalAlignment?: string, anchorHorizontalAlignmentMetadata?: record, anchorIgnoreIfNotPresent?: string, anchorIgnoreIfNotPresentMetadata?: record, anchorMatchWholeWord?: string, anchorMatchWholeWordMetadata?: record, anchorString?: string, anchorStringMetadata?: record, anchorTabProcessorVersion?: string, ... (103 more fields)}
